            "value" : "Besuch Nummer %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wartet auf Freigabe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval. Only you can see this place." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wartet auf Freigabe. Nur du siehst diesen Ort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting to upload" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wartet auf Upload"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Was on a flight with you" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "War mit dir auf einem Flug"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We sent a link to %@. Open it on this iPhone to sign in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir haben einen Link an %@ gesendet. Öffne ihn auf diesem iPhone, um dich anzumelden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll email you a link to sign in. You don't need a password." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir senden dir per E-Mail einen Link zum Anmelden. Du brauchst kein Passwort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What happened?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was ist passiert?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's new" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neuigkeiten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wann"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where is it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wo ist er?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which flight?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Welcher Flug?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who can see this" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer das sieht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who can see this check-in is decided by its visibility, not by its date." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer diesen Check-in sieht, bestimmt die Sichtbarkeit, nicht das Datum."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why do you want to report %@?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warum möchtest du %@ melden?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wingspot can tell you when someone follows you, or salutes or comments on one of your check-ins. You can change this in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wingspot kann dir sagen, wenn dir jemand folgt oder einen deiner Check-ins salutiert oder kommentiert. Du kannst das in den Einstellungen ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wingspot is for people who love aircraft. To keep it friendly, please agree to these rules before you follow people, see the feed, or share your check-ins." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wingspot ist für Menschen, die Flugzeuge lieben. Damit es freundlich bleibt, stimme bitte diesen Regeln zu, bevor du Leuten folgst, den Feed siehst oder deine Check-ins teilst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Arbeit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write a comment…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kommentar schreiben …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You already have a flight %@ on this day. Save it only if it is another flight." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast an diesem Tag schon einen Flug %@. Speichere ihn nur, wenn es ein anderer Flug ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You already have ten places waiting for approval. Please wait until some are approved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast schon zehn Orte, die auf Freigabe warten. Bitte warte, bis einige freigegeben sind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You already logged %@ on %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast %1$@ am %2$@ schon eingetragen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also block someone on their profile, so you don't see them anymore." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst jemanden auch in seinem Profil blockieren, dann siehst du ihn nicht mehr."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can only compare with people whose profile you may see." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst nur mit Leuten vergleichen, deren Profil du sehen darfst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can report a person, check-in or comment, and block anyone. We review reports and may remove content or accounts that break these rules." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst Personen, Check-ins und Kommentare melden und jeden blockieren. Wir prüfen Meldungen und können Inhalte oder Konten entfernen, die gegen diese Regeln verstoßen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You get a notification when this person checks in, for the check-ins you can see. They are not told." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bekommst eine Mitteilung, wenn diese Person eincheckt, für Check-ins, die du sehen kannst. Die Person erfährt davon nichts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You haven't checked in here yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast hier noch nicht eingecheckt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You haven't seen this aircraft yet." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast dieses Flugzeug noch nicht gesehen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You haven't seen this aircraft yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You haven't seen this type yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast diesen Typ noch nicht gesehen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You now follow %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du folgst jetzt %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You won't be tagged on it again, and you won't see it any more unless it is public." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du wirst dort nicht erneut markiert und siehst den Check-in nicht mehr, außer er ist öffentlich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You won't see each other's check-ins or comments anymore, and any follows between you end." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ihr seht keine Check-ins und Kommentare voneinander mehr, und bestehende Follows enden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline. Please connect to the internet and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist offline. Bitte verbinde dich mit dem Internet und versuche es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're responsible for what you post. Comments with insults are refused automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
